      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6180ae68bea5682298f525e2|full_name}: You usually turn the HUD off to take pictures or something. Having icons appear on it during picture taking would be really annoying.\nA sound sounds like a better idea.\nA sound for vote-kicks while some joker is spamming them on everyone would be really annoying though.",
